WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Collapsing Memory-Void, desperate.

2
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:06.300 align:center
Lyra: No! Not this one!

3
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:08.600 align:center
Echo Shard: Unburden yourself. It is... heavy.

4
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:09.900 align:center
Lyra: Never!

5
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:12.200 align:center
Kael: The fall... it takes everything...

6
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:17.500 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Fragmented Memory-Platform, tense.

7
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:18.800 align:center
Lyra: A trap!

8
00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:21.100 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Cease your struggle. Become... whole.

9
00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:22.400 align:center
Lyra: Not like this!

10
00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:24.700 align:center
Kael: It weaves... a beautiful lie...

11
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Destabilizing Memory-Corridor, urgent.

12
00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:31.300 align:center
Lyra: Damn it!

13
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:32.600 align:center
Lyra: Too slow!

14
00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:34.900 align:center
Kael: Some things... must go...

15
00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:36.200 align:center
Lyra: I remember... something!

16
00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:39.500 align:center
♪ at dusk, in Shifting Memory-Canyons, tense.

17
00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:40.800 align:center
Lyra: There!

18
00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:42.100 align:center
Lyra: Almost...

19
00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:44.400 align:center
Kael: A spark... from the beginning...

20
00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:47.700 align:center
♪ at dusk, in Shard's Perch, desperate.

21
00:00:47.1000 --> 00:00:48.1000 align:center
Lyra: Too many!

22
00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:51.300 align:center
Hunter-Echo: Relinquish. It does not belong.

23
00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:52.600 align:center
Lyra: Mine! Get back!

24
00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:54.900 align:center
Kael: They remember... the hunger...

25
00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.200 align:center
♪ at dusk, in Crumbling Memory-Ledge, urgent.

26
00:00:58.500 --> 00:00:59.500 align:center
Lyra: No! My arm!

27
00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:01.800 align:center
Lyra: Should have used it!

28
00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:04.100 align:center
Hunter-Echo: Your weakness... is clear.

29
00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:06.400 align:center
Kael: Holding on... can break you...

30
00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:11.700 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Purifying Memory-Chamber, dread.

31
00:01:11.1000 --> 00:01:12.1000 align:center
Lyra: What is this?

32
00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:15.300 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: We make them clean. Free.

33
00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:16.600 align:center
Lyra: You destroy them!

34
00:01:16.900 --> 00:01:18.900 align:center
Kael: It believes... it helps...

35
00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:25.200 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Loom's Maw (edge of the chamber), urgent.

36
00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:26.500 align:center
Lyra: Now!

37
00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:28.800 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Stop her. It is vital.

38
00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:30.100 align:center
Lyra: Got it!

39
00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:31.400 align:center
Kael: Run! Run!

40
00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:34.700 align:center
♪ at dawn, in Destabilizing Memory-Bridge, dread.

41
00:01:34.1000 --> 00:01:35.1000 align:center
Lyra: The bridge!

42
00:01:36.300 --> 00:01:38.300 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: You cannot outrun... the inevitable.

43
00:01:38.600 --> 00:01:39.600 align:center
Lyra: Almost there!

44
00:01:39.900 --> 00:01:40.900 align:center
Kael: It consumes... everything...

45
00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:46.200 align:center
♪ at dawn, in Edge of the Abyss of Forgetting, desperate.

46
00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:47.500 align:center
Lyra: No... I can't!

47
00:01:47.800 --> 00:01:48.800 align:center
Kael: Don't... please...

48
00:01:49.100 --> 00:01:50.100 align:center
Lyra: I have to!

49
00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:52.400 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Relinquish. It is your fate.

50
00:01:53.700 --> 00:01:56.700 align:center
♪ at dawn, in The Void's Embrace, dread.

51
00:01:56.1000 --> 00:01:57.1000 align:center
Lyra: Gone...

52
00:01:58.300 --> 00:01:59.300 align:center
Kael: A piece... lost...

53
00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:01.600 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: The memory... was never yours.

54
00:02:01.900 --> 00:02:02.900 align:center
Lyra: What was it?
